      "content": "but that feels so hollow. people keep telling me to \"rest\" or \"find myself\" but there's nothing to find. if the core of who i was was my vision, and that's dead... then what's the point of the rest of the script? it feels like i'm just a character waiting for the curtain to fall because there's no more substance to the play.",
